        {
          "name": "Stripe Webhook (Manual Test)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Stripe-Signature",
                "value": "",
                "description": "Stripe webhook signature. Use Stripe CLI for real testing: `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:8082/v1/webhooks/stripe`"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"evt_test_123\",\n  \"object\": \"event\",\n  \"type\": \"payment_intent.succeeded\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"object\": {\n      \"id\": \"pi_test_123\",\n      \"object\": \"payment_intent\",\n      \"status\": \"succeeded\"\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{webhook_base_url}}/v1/webhooks/stripe",
              "host": ["{{webhook_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "webhooks", "stripe"]
            },
            "description": "**Note**: This endpoint requires a valid Stripe signature. For testing:\n\n1. Install Stripe CLI\n2. Run: `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:8082/v1/webhooks/stripe`\n3. Use `stripe trigger payment_intent.succeeded` to send test events\n\nThe signature verification will fail if sent manually without proper signing."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Invalid Signature",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"evt_test_123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{webhook_base_url}}/v1/webhooks/stripe"
                }
              },
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"missing stripe signature\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Webhook endpoints for receiving provider callbacks.\n\nFor Stripe testing, use the Stripe CLI:\n```bash\n# Forward webhooks to local webhook service\nstripe listen --forward-to localhost:8082/v1/webhooks/stripe\n\n# Trigger test events\nstripe trigger payment_intent.succeeded\nstripe trigger payment_intent.payment_failed\n```"
    },
